REGIONAL REGULATION OF BADUNG REGENCY

NUMBER 15 OF 2013

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF BADUNG,

Considering : a. that every citizen has the right to obtain security and freedom from all forms of Violence;

b. that Women and Children are vulnerable groups who tend to experience Violence which constitutes acts violating human rights and need to receive legal Protection;

